<Base title="Terms of Use" description="The simple terms for using UsedGlass.ca.">
  <div style="max-width:760px">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="muted">Effective November 5, 2026</p>
    <p>Thanks for using UsedGlass.ca. By using the site, you agree to these simple terms.</p>

    <h2 id="as-is">Information is provided as is</h2>
    <p>UsedGlass.ca is a free tool to help you compare used camera gear. We work hard to keep it accurate, but we provide everything on the site "as is", without guarantees of any kind.</p>

    <h2 id="listings">Prices and listings come from dealers</h2>
    <p>Prices, condition grades and availability come from third-party dealer websites. They're shown as of the time we last checked, they change often, and they may be wrong or out of date. Our model matching and "deal" flags are automatic and can make mistakes too. Always confirm the details on the dealer's own site before you buy. Any purchase is between you and the dealer.</p>

    <h2 id="independent">We're independent</h2>
    <p>UsedGlass.ca isn't affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any of the dealers, retailers or manufacturers we list. Their names and trademarks belong to their owners.</p>

    <h2 id="automated">Automated access and reuse</h2>
    <p>You may use UsedGlass.ca in a normal browser for personal, non-commercial browsing. Automated scraping, bulk downloading, crawling outside of ordinary search engines that follow our robots.txt, or any other systematic collection of content from this site is not allowed, including by scripts, bots, AI agents, or similar tools.</p>
    <p>You may not copy, reuse, republish, or train AI models on the site's content for commercial purposes without a written licence from us. That includes our organization of listings, model matching, deal flags, text, design, and code. Trying to get around technical blocks (including rate limits, bot challenges, or robots.txt) is also not allowed.</p>
    <p>Listings, prices, photos, and product details that come from third parties (including eBay and its sellers, and other dealers) belong to them, not to us. We claim no ownership of that material. We do claim the way we organize and present it on UsedGlass.ca, plus our matching, deal flags, original text, design, and software. Nothing on this site gives you a licence to take, redistribute, or train models on third-party listing content. eBay public listings shown here must stay visually separate from dealer listings; that separation is part of how the site works and must not be removed in any copy or reuse.</p>
    <p>Alberta and Canada law still apply.</p>

    <h2 id="affiliates">Affiliate disclosure</h2>
    <p>Some links are affiliate links, so we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. {AMAZON_DISCLOSURE} Affiliate links never change the prices we show or how listings are ranked. See our <a href={u('privacy/#affiliates')}>Privacy Policy</a> for how affiliate cookies work.</p>

    <h2 id="liability">Limits on our responsibility</h2>
    <p>To the extent the law allows, UsedGlass.ca isn't responsible for losses that come from using the site, relying on its information, or buying from a dealer or retailer we link to. Other websites we link to have their own terms and policies.</p>

    <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. We'll change the effective date above when we do. These terms are governed by the laws of Alberta and Canada.</p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@usedglass.ca">hello@usedglass.ca</a>, or write to UsedGlass.ca, PO Box 1604, Okotoks, AB T1S 1B5, Canada.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
